# A non-zero SIP coefficient above its declared order: A_3_0 = 1e-8 with
# A_ORDER = 2 (synthetic, from the round-3 verifier probe
# p01_beyond_order_nonzero). wcslib 8.10 never reads A_ORDER (sipset takes
# the degree from the coefficients present), so it ACCEPTS the header and
# applies A_3_0. The header contradicts itself (is the polynomial of order
# 2 or 3?); we refuse it.
# AP/BP are given so hdr2sky injects nothing.
# EXPECT-GO-ERROR: A_3_0 = 1e-08 has degree 3 > A_ORDER = 2
NOTE stricter: sip_beyond_order_nonzero
GRID 1 1024 9 1 1024 9
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 1024
NAXIS2  = 1024
CRVAL1  = 150.0
CRVAL2  = 2.0
CRPIX1  = 512.5
CRPIX2  = 512.5
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'
CD1_1   = -0.0002777
CD1_2   = 0.0
CD2_1   = 0.0
CD2_2   = 0.0002777
A_ORDER = 2
B_ORDER = 2
A_2_0   = 2e-5
A_1_1   = 1e-5
B_0_2   = 2e-5
B_1_1   = -1e-5
A_3_0   = 1e-8
AP_ORDER= 1
AP_0_0  = 0.0
BP_ORDER= 1
BP_0_0  = 0.0
